law.text:
		In addition to any other powers granted to the Board under this title, the Board shall have the powers to:

Establish policies and procedures to implement and administer the program and the provisions of this chapter;


Contract for the provision of comprehensive case management;


Take all other actions necessary for the implementation and administration of the program; and


Adopt rules and policies that bring the program into compliance with any applicable law or regulation of this Commonwealth or the United States.
